            "body": "Four PRs fix the same FutureMap.stash device mismatch: #36200, #39222, #39281, #43099. Measured on an M4 Pro: copying the payload to MPS per stash (#43099, #36200) blocks 25 ms when MLX work is in flight. Allocating the FutureMap on the pool device (#39222) keeps every write same device, under 0.1 ms; #39281 does the same behind a `use_mlx()` check.\r\n\r\nSuggest landing #39222 with #43099’s test and closing the rest toward it.",
